  "details": "This is a thing that has been going on for a while for me. Sometimes when I enable a  mirror while being in full body, my avatars hip is being moved for a short while. I've made sure that it's not my tracker being moved in steam-vr.\n\nI speculate that it's when it's creating a mirror clone of my avatar. Since it only happens when I've been without mirrors for a while and I enable one. Most noticeable if you sit down and have moved your playspace a bit. Happens on both personal mirror and mirrors in world.\n\nWhen the hip is moved. Other people can see it as well. so it's not only being seen locally.\n\nThe behavior can be seen on this avatar: avtr_22b4568f-bee1-44cc-80be-99ff14ac41b5\n\nAdded a compilation video of some of the times where I've caught it.",
